        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "right",
      "name": "梅尔",
      "text": "那想等多改几轮再玩，也没错呀？对白得一句句看，翻得好不好，很影响体验的。",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 80,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 5,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "left",
      "name": "兰德",
      "text": "没错。等后续修订，确实可能等来更好的文本、更少的问题。",
